//--- Neighbourhood management page: the slot rows (NeighbourhoodPanelModel) ---
//--- The detail line's separator ("  -  ") and the list of characters a name may not
//--- contain are deliberately NOT here. The separator is layout punctuation that the panel
//--- also has to split a row back apart on, and the character list is a property of the
//--- filesystem rather than of a language: a translator who "fixed" either would break the
//--- page rather than translate it.
//--- %s is a folder name (UserData4) or a name the player typed, %d a slot number. ---
