301 ^Not created^
302 ^No area template^
303 ^named^
304 ^open now^
305 ^All nine neighbourhoods are in use. Delete one to make room for another.^
306 ^No The Sims install path is known, so a neighbourhood cannot be copied in.^
307 ^That did not work. See the Simitone log for the reason.^

