//--- are; the same string serves the Open refusal, because it is the same sentence. ---
308 ^That is not one of the %d neighbourhoods.^
309 ^The first neighbourhood is the one Simitone starts from, so it cannot be deleted.^
310 ^This is the neighbourhood that is open right now. Go to another one and come back to delete it.^

