312 ^Open {0}? The neighbourhood that is open now, {1}, will be closed, and anything in it that you have not saved will be lost.^
313 ^Open {0}? The neighbourhood that is open now will be closed, and anything in it that you have not saved will be lost.^
314 ^It has changes that have not been saved. Yes saves it and then opens the other one, No opens the other one without saving, and Cancel goes back.^
315 ^That neighbourhood could not be opened, so the one you were in is still open. See the Simitone log for the reason.^
316 ^That neighbourhood could not be opened, and the one you were in could not be put back either. Restart Simitone; the Simitone log has the reason.^
317 ^The neighbourhood could not be saved, so nothing was switched. See the Simitone log for the reason.^
318 ^That neighbourhood was opened, but its map could not be drawn. See the Simitone log for the reason; if it keeps happening, restart Simitone.^
319 ^Neighbourhoods can only be opened from the neighbourhood map.^

